I've one and installed Debian on it a while ago (Woody).
No particuliar issues, except the TGA graphics card (8bits only) and a
particularly small disk (520MB).
You can expect P166MHz-like performance for the 233MHz version, not much.

It can be tricky to install a boot loader (MILO or aboot). Take your
